---
const title = "Privacy Policy | Eqho";
const description = "Privacy policy for Eqho — 100% offline voice-to-text dictation. Your voice is processed locally on your PC and never uploaded.";
import SiteHeader from '../components/SiteHeader.astro';
import SiteFooter from '../components/SiteFooter.astro';
import { SUPPORT_EMAIL } from '../lib/site';
const updated = "26 November 2026";
---
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
    <title>{title}</title>
    <meta name="description" content={description} />
    <link rel="canonical" href="https://eqho.damt.xyz/privacy/" />
    <link rel="icon" type="image/png" sizes="32x32" href="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/DanielMevit/eqho/main/assets/logo_32_dark.png" media="(prefers-color-scheme: light)" />
    <link rel="icon" type="image/png" sizes="32x32" href="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/DanielMevit/eqho/main/assets/logo_32_white.png" media="(prefers-color-scheme: dark)" />
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com" />
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin />
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@400;500;600&display=swap" rel="stylesheet" />
    <meta property="og:title" content={title} />
    <meta property="og:description" content={description} />
    <meta property="og:type" content="website" />
    <meta property="og:url" content="https://eqho.damt.xyz/privacy/" />
    <style>
      :root {
        --color-bg: #0d1117;
        --color-card-bg: #161b22;
        --color-text: #c9d1d9;
        --color-heading: #ffffff;
        --color-blue: #58a6ff;
        --color-muted: #8b949e;
        --color-border: #30363d;
      }
      * { box-sizing: border-box; }
      body {
        font-family: 'Inter', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;
        background-color: var(--color-bg);
        color: var(--color-text);
        line-height: 1.65;
        margin: 0;
        -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;
      }
      main { max-width: 820px; margin: 2.5rem auto 0; padding: 0 clamp(16px, 4vw, 64px); box-sizing: content-box; }
      .updated { color: var(--color-muted); font-size: 0.9rem; margin: 0 0 1.5rem; }
      a { color: var(--color-blue); text-decoration: none; }
      a:hover { text-decoration: underline; }
      h1 { color: var(--color-heading); font-size: 2.5rem; font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: -0.02em; margin: 0 0 0.4rem; }
      .lede { color: var(--color-muted); margin: 0 0 2.5rem; font-size: 1.05rem; }
      .card {
        background: var(--color-card-bg);
        border: 1px solid var(--color-border);
        border-radius: 14px;
        padding: 1.5rem 1.75rem;
        margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
      }
      .card h2 {
        color: var(--color-heading);
        font-size: 1.15rem;
        font-weight: 600;
        margin: 0 0 0.65rem;
      }
      .card p { margin: 0 0 0.75rem; }
      .card p:last-child { margin-bottom: 0; }
      ul { margin: 0.4rem 0 0.75rem; padding-left: 1.25rem; }
      li { margin-bottom: 0.45rem; }
      li:last-child { margin-bottom: 0; }
      code {
        background: rgba(88, 166, 255, 0.1);
        color: var(--color-heading);
        padding: 0.12rem 0.4rem;
        border-radius: 5px;
        font-size: 0.9em;
      }
      @media (max-width: 620px) {
        h1 { font-size: 2rem; }
        .card { padding: 1.25rem; }
      }
    </style>
  </head>
  <body>
    <SiteHeader />
    <main>
      <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
      <p class="lede">
        Eqho does not collect, store on any server, sell, or share your personal data or voice recordings.
        Everything runs locally on your computer.
      </p>

      <section class="card">
        <h2>Microphone &amp; voice audio</h2>
        <p>
          Eqho accesses your microphone only while you actively dictate (after you press your chosen hotkey or click Start Dictation).
          As soon as you stop or cancel dictation, the microphone stream closes immediately.
        </p>
        <p>
          All speech recognition runs 100% locally on your own CPU or graphics card using <code>whisper.cpp</code>.
          Audio is kept in memory only for the duration of the phrase being transcribed — it is never written to disk and never sent over the internet.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="card">
        <h2>Files stored locally on your PC</h2>
        <p>Eqho keeps only your local configuration and downloaded speech models on your own device:</p>
        <ul>
          <li><code>%APPDATA%\Eqho\settings.json</code> — your hotkey, language, theme, overlay, custom vocabulary, and replacement preferences.</li>
          <li><code>%APPDATA%\Eqho\history.jsonl</code> — local transcript history (optional; can be disabled or cleared at any time in Eqho).</li>
          <li><code>%APPDATA%\Eqho\eqho.log</code> — technical diagnostics and crash logs. Your dictated text and audio are never written to log files.</li>
          <li><code>%APPDATA%\Eqho\license.json</code> — Microsoft Store edition only: locally cached Store trial or purchase status so Eqho continues working while offline.</li>
          <li><code>%LOCALAPPDATA%\Eqho\models\</code> — local GGML Whisper speech model files that you choose to download.</li>
        </ul>
        <p>Deleting those folders removes all Eqho data from your computer.</p>
      </section>

      <section class="card">
        <h2>Network activity</h2>
        <p>Eqho contains no telemetry, no analytics, no ads, and no user accounts. Network requests occur only in two explicit cases:</p>
        <ul>
          <li>
            <strong>Downloading a speech model you choose:</strong> When you download a Whisper model during first-run setup or in the Models tab, Eqho fetches the selected GGML model file over HTTPS from Hugging Face. Once downloaded, dictation works completely offline.
          </li>
          <li>
            <strong>Microsoft Store licence checks (Store edition only):</strong> The Microsoft Store edition uses the built-in Windows <code>Windows.Services.Store.StoreContext</code> API to check your 15-day free trial or purchase status through the Microsoft Store.
          </li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <section class="card">
        <h2>Clipboard &amp; active window</h2>
        <p>
          When inserting dictated text using Clipboard mode, Eqho marks the pasted text as private (excluded from Windows Win+V clipboard history and cloud clipboard sync) and restores your previous clipboard text immediately afterward.
          Eqho reads the active window handle solely to restore focus before inserting your dictation and to apply any per-app paste rules you configure.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="card">
        <h2>This website &amp; contact</h2>
        <p>
          This documentation site uses no cookies, no analytics scripts, and no third-party tracking.
        </p>
        <p>
          Questions about privacy? Email <a href={`mailto:${SUPPORT_EMAIL}`}>{SUPPORT_EMAIL}</a>.
        </p>
      </section>

      <p class="updated">Last updated {updated}</p>
    </main>
    <SiteFooter />
  </body>
</html>
